# EAS build packaging ignore rules.
#
# IMPORTANT: this is intentionally separate from .gitignore. If this file
# exists, EAS uses it INSTEAD OF .gitignore to decide what to include in the
# project archive it builds from - so anything listed here (or in .gitignore,
# if this file didn't exist) would be silently excluded from the actual
# build, even if it exists on disk when `eas build` runs.
#
# google-services.json is deliberately NOT listed here (even though it IS
# gitignored) because our CI workflow decodes it from a secret right before
# building, and it needs to be present in the packaged archive for the
# Firebase config plugin to pick it up during prebuild.

node_modules/
.git/
.expo/
android/
ios/
*.apk
*.aab
*.log
.DS_Store
build.apk
build.aab
service-account.json
